# Local, per-machine default for `make release-macos`/`release-macos-amd64`'s
# MACOS_SIGN_IDENTITY -- see the Makefile comment above that var. Not committed since a
# different build machine would have a different cert; this just saves whoever's building on
# *this* machine from needing to know/paste the identity string every time.
/.macos-sign-identity
# Same for the notarytool keychain profile scripts/release-all.sh notarizes macOS builds with.
/.macos-notary-profile
